                  "text": "Luk 19:47",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kiboikinos irichuna nabo kilipa ngirwa daang sodi taanyuneta agogongu na ipuunotor anakiro kadaang ana esubakinosi, dio towaatar alongaren Lokookeng a Itwaan.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.21.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.21.36"
            ]
